# Prints the frame at which the firmware commits a machine type: the first NR 0x03 write
# whose bits 2:0 are 001..100 (zxnext.vhd:5708-5712: the write that clears config mode).
# Used by the regression harness (boot_shift in test-functions.inc) to anchor every
# boot-timeline frame of a row to the card's own boot.
on nextreg 0x03 once when (VALUE & 7) >= 1 and (VALUE & 7) <= 4 do
    log "BOOT-COMMIT FRAME=${FRAME} NR03=${VALUE:x2}"
    exit 0
end
